      "claim": "long i before nf",
      "against": "Lewis &amp; Short leaves the prefix unmarked (<em>in-fundo</em>)",
      "html": "A vowel is long before nf and ns: Cicero (Orat. 159) says <span lang=\"la\">inhūmānus</span> with a short first syllable but <span lang=\"la\">īnfēlīx</span> and <span lang=\"la\">īnsānus</span> with a long one. The root vowel of <span lang=\"la\">fundō</span> stays short."
    }
  },
